## COMMUNICATION
Page No. – Page No.
2D c-MOF based organic spin valves: Layer-by-layer assembly was applied to fabricate highly crystalline and oriented thin films of 2D conductive MOF, $\mathsf{C u}_{3}(\mathsf{H H T P})_{2}$ , on the $\mathsf{L a}_{0.67}\mathsf{S r}_{0.33}\mathsf{M n O}_{3}$ (LSMO) ferromagnetic electrode. Large magnetoresistance (MR) of $25\%$ for this $\mathsf{L S M O/C u_{3}(H H T P)_{2}/C o}$ organic spin valves (OSVs) was achieved. This work demonstrates promising applications of 2D $c$ -MOFs in spintronics.
